# Only ship what's needed for the theme
**/.git*
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode/**
**/node_modules/**
**/tmp/**
**/scripts/**
**/tests/**
**/*.psd
**/*.ai
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.sh
**/*.py
**/*.toml
**/*.lock
**/*.md
# Screenshots are served from GitHub raw URLs in the README, so the vsix
# does not need to carry 5 MB of PNGs
assets/**
!README.md
!package.json
!icon.png
!silkcircuit-*.json
